        <mxCell id="facts" value="&lt;b&gt;Collected:&lt;/b&gt; 2026-09-30 15:03 from dc01.contoso.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forest level:&lt;/b&gt; Windows Server 2016&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schema:&lt;/b&gt; Windows Server 2025&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Domains:&lt;/b&gt; 2 &amp;#183; &lt;b&gt;Sites:&lt;/b&gt; 5 &amp;#183; &lt;b&gt;Subnets:&lt;/b&gt; 6 &amp;#183; &lt;b&gt;Site links:&lt;/b&gt; 3&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Domain controllers:&lt;/b&gt; 6 (1 read-only, 5 global catalogs)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DC operating systems&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2012 R2: 1&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2016: 1&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2019: 1&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2022: 1&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2025: 2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1">
